  "title": "Qt: Qt6/GCC13 issue",
  "description": "GCC 13 on Fedora 38 with Qt6 is having build issues that are the same as\nwireshark/wireshark!7878\n\n```\n$ make qtui\n[  0%] Automatic MOC and UIC for target qtui\n[ 11%] Built target qtui_autogen\n[ 11%] Building CXX object ui/qt/CMakeFiles/qtui.dir/interface_toolbar.cpp.o\nIn file included from /usr/include/qt6/QtCore/qarraydatapointer.h:7,\n                 from /usr/include/qt6/QtCore/qbytearray.h:12,\n                 from /usr/include/qt6/QtCore/qstringview.h:8,\n                 from /usr/include/qt6/QtCore/qchar.h:651,\n                 from /usr/include/qt6/QtCore/qstring.h:14,\n                 from /usr/include/qt6/QtCore/qobject.h:11,\n                 from /usr/include/qt6/QtWidgets/qwidget.h:9,\n                 from /usr/include/qt6/QtWidgets/qdialog.h:8,\n                 from /usr/include/qt6/QtWidgets/QDialog:1,\n                 from /home/dvaneeden/dev/wireshark/ui/qt/geometry_state_dialog.h:13,\n                 from /home/dvaneeden/dev/wireshark/ui/qt/funnel_text_dialog.h:16,\n                 from /home/dvaneeden/dev/wireshark/ui/qt/interface_toolbar.h:16,\n                 from /home/dvaneeden/dev/wireshark/ui/qt/interface_toolbar.cpp:19:\nIn member function ‘void QtPrivate::QPodArrayOps<T>::copyAppend(const T*, const T*) [with T = int]’,\n    inlined from ‘void QList<T>::reserve(qsizetype) [with T = int]’ at /usr/include/qt6/QtCore/qlist.h:735:25:\n/usr/include/qt6/QtCore/qarraydataops.h:62:17: error: ‘void* memcpy(void*, const void*, size_t)’ accessing 9223372036854775808 or more bytes at offsets [-4611686018427387904, 4611686018427387903] and 0 may overlap up to 9223372036854775809 bytes at offset -1 [-Werror=restrict]\n   62 |         ::memcpy(static_cast<void *>(this->end()), static_cast<const void *>(b), (e - b) * sizeof(T));\n      |         ~~~~~~~~^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\ncc1plus: all warnings being treated as errors\nmake[3]: *** [ui/qt/CMakeFiles/qtui.dir/build.make:1134: ui/qt/CMakeFiles/qtui.dir/interface_toolbar.cpp.o] Error 1\nmake[2]: *** [CMakeFiles/Makefile2:11585: ui/qt/CMakeFiles/qtui.dir/all] Error 2\nmake[1]: *** [CMakeFiles/Makefile2:11592: ui/qt/CMakeFiles/qtui.dir/rule] Error 2\nmake: *** [Makefile:4196: qtui] Error 2\n```\n\n```\n$ gcc --version\ngcc (GCC) 13.0.1 20230401 (Red Hat 13.0.1-0)\nCopyright (C) 2023 Free Software Foundation, Inc.\nThis is free software; see the source for copying conditions.  There is NO\nwarranty; not even for MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.\n```",
